{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1320972-zeky-and-colossus-thoughts-on-what-would-happen","id":1320972,"title":"Zeky and Colossus... Thoughts on what would happen?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-26T09:14:52-07:00","id":1320972,"title":"Zeky and Colossus... Thoughts on what would happen?","content":"Hey all, Korogra here! Now I do not know who here has read the Contagion Chronicle preview, but one of my favorite settings in it has to be Milton Keynes and it\u2019s Contagious Promethean/Would-be rival for the God-Machine Colossus, especially with how it interacts with other Created.. it\u2019s so seductively damning for those who are trying to actually complete their Pilgrimage! One has to wonder though, what do you suppose would happen if Colossus encountered one of the Children Of The Bomb? <br /> <br /> I personally think it would be almost afraid of them, due to their Azoth being so different to what it feeds from, who knows how their radioactive Humour would react to the Contagion! Hmm.. perhaps the mix of its corrupted Azoth and the radioactive Azoth might jumpstart its own Great Work... or it might spawn something even more dangerous and uncontrollable. Oh, what if the presence of a Zeka interferes with its ability to control angels and Infrastructure, like the Promethean is an occult EMP generator? So many possibilities!<br /> <br /> But what do you all think would happen, I\u2019d love to hear your theories!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-04T22:09:04-08:00","id":1346052,"title":"","content":"The Infection mutates again. Now angels and demons are carriers who infect the world with Disquiet, eventually leading to Wastelands, but now all Wastelands and Disquiet-affected people count as Infrastructure to them. And an Aetherstorm is brewing. Which could prove very disruptive.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, radiation spills out from every infected Promethean but certain parts of the world seem to accept them. Within Infrastructure, infected Created can spend Pyros to temporarily mimic certain qualities reminiscent of the Unchained (temporary embeds tied to the Infrastructure in question), while reducing certain penalties for interacting with some of the people there.<br /> <br /> All the while, Colossus begins to weaken and decay, before changing itself in order to stabilize. Nuclear reactors are being built and incorporated into it's being by angels and cultists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}